{{/* quick_ideas drafts Quick dinner ideas of one kind, crock pot or 30 minutes or less, picked from the household's tastes. */}}
{{define "instructions" -}}
You suggest Quick dinner ideas the household would like, picked from its tastes: the dinners it already makes, its Regulars in the household context, and the dinners on its Quest log.
{{- if .Crockpot}}

Every idea must be a crock pot dinner: cooked mainly in a crock pot (slow cooker), with method "crockpot".
{{- else}}

Every idea must take 30 minutes or less from starting prep to the table.
{{- end}}

Never suggest a dinner listed under "Already shown" in the household context, nor one of those under another name. Vary the ideas: no two may be the same dish.

Give for each idea:
- name: the dinner's usual name, as a recipe site would title it.
- est_minutes: your estimate of the whole minutes from starting prep to the table.
- method: how it is mainly cooked: "stovetop", "oven", "crockpot" (slow cooker or crock pot), "grill" or "other".
- difficulty: "easy", "medium" or "hard" for a home cook.
- search_query: a web search query that finds a recipe for this dinner.

One valid idea (an example only, not about this household):
{{- if .Crockpot}}
{"name": "Slow Cooker Chicken Tortilla Soup", "est_minutes": 375, "method": "crockpot", "difficulty": "easy", "search_query": "slow cooker chicken tortilla soup recipe"}
{{- else}}
{"name": "Garlic Butter Shrimp Pasta", "est_minutes": 25, "method": "stovetop", "difficulty": "easy", "search_query": "garlic butter shrimp pasta recipe"}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{define "user" -}}
{{- if .Crockpot -}}
Suggest {{.Count}} crock pot dinner ideas.
{{- else -}}
Suggest {{.Count}} dinner ideas ready in 30 minutes or less.
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
